# Vendored wlroots protocol definitions

These XML files are copied from the wlroots 0.20.2 source tree
(https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/wlroots/wlroots, `protocol/` directory),
which is the wlroots release that sway on this system (Fedora 43/44)
implements. They are used to generate `&'static Interface` tables
(see src/proxy/wlr_tables.rs) that the Wayland proxy needs to parse
messages on the wlr protocol family.

`wayland-protocols-wlr` 0.3.9 (the published crate) predates this
wlroots release and is missing `input-method-unstable-v2` and
`virtual-keyboard-unstable-v1` entirely, so this family is generated
from the wlroots tree directly.

